`Playlist` is a C# **class** with one public field: `string[] Tracks`. Arrays are reference types.

```csharp
var p = new Playlist { Tracks = new[] { "intro", "theme" } };
var q = p;
var saved = p.Tracks;
q.Tracks = new[] { "remix" };
q.Tracks[0] = "live";
```

After all five lines run, `p.Tracks[0]` is {{pTrack}} and `saved[0]` is {{savedTrack}}.
